ic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008440000</span>8,440<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">4 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_House_of_Broken_Chains\" title=\"The House of Broken Chains\">The House of Broken Chains</a></b>, <sup>1</sup>End chest&#160;; <br /><sup>1</sup><a href=\"/page/Slavemaster_Banister_Avithoul\" title=\"Slavemaster Banister Avithoul\">Slavemaster Banister Avithoul</a> rare chest in the <a href=\"/page/The_Underdark\" title=\"The Underdark\">The Underdark</a>&#160;; <br /> <sup>2</sup><a href=\"/page/Menace_of_the_Underdark:_City_of_Portals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Menace of the Underdark: City of Portals\">Menace of the Underdark: City of Portals</a>, Quest chain end reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nightshade_Venom\" title=\"Nightshade Venom\">Nightshade Venom</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nightshade_Venom\" title=\"Nightshade Venom\">Nightshade Venom</a>:</b> Any creature struck by this weapon must succeed on a Difficulty Check 22 <a href=\"/page/Fortitude_save\" title=\"Fortitude save\">Fortitude save</a> or fall unconscious. The target may attempt a new save to end the effect every several seconds; otherwise the <a href=\"/page/Sleep\" title=\"Sleep\">sleep</a> lasts for 20 seconds.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Poison_Burst#Poison_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison Burst\">Poison Burst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Poison_Burst#Poison_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison Burst\">Poison Burst</a>:</b> This weapon is dripping with poison, and deals 1 to 6 poison damage each hit. Critical hits deal an additional 1 to 10 poison damage for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 2 to 20 for a x3 multiplier and 3 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a>:</b> This weapon is cruelly sharp and will do an additional 1 to 8 damage to targets that are vulnerable to bleeding.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Poison_(enchantment)#Constitution_Poison,_Virulent\" title=\"Poison (enchantment)\">Constitution Poison, Virulent</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Poison_(enchantment)#Constitution_Poison,_Virulent\" title=\"Poison (enchantment)\">Constitution Poison, Virulent</a>: </b> The deadly poison coating this weapon deals one point of constitution damage every time it strikes an enemy, and an additional 1 to 6 points of constitution damage when it scores a critical hit. Some creatures may be immune or resistant to ability damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\"> Insightful Sneak Attack Bonus +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\"> Insightful Sneak Attack Bonus +3</a></b>&#160;: Provides a +3 Insightful modifier to your attack bonus and a +5 Insightful bonus to damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Slaver%27s_Hand_Crossbow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Slaver%27s_Hand_Crossbow.png/420px-Slaver%27s_Hand_Crossbow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"661\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Slaver%27s_Hand_Crossbow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>House Avithoul has perfected many a poison and alchemical concoction designed to incapacitate a victim. This drow crossbow automatically coats the tip of any bolt it fires in a potent mix of such venoms.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>This item, like the others from this chain, can be acquired as an end reward for the chain as <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230121\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4693/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37975/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12718/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n125.91%  143.306     74 Template:IO\n100.00%  113.818      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  113.818      1 -total\n 97.40%  110.864      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 40.81%   46.453      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.10%   45.639      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.82%   44.182      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.93%   43.171      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.45%   22.138      9 Template:Popup\n 14.96%   17.026      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24223-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817230121 and revision id 677122. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
